<title>USA: Celadon Group Inc Q4 June 30 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Celadon Group Inc Q4 June 30 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $1.32	 loss     $0.29</p>
<p> Net loss	  10,300	loss     2,300</p>
<p> Revs		42,900		   30,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  7,751		    7,941</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 includes loss $6.4 million, or $0.82 a share from discontinued operations, compared to a loss of $2.2 million, or $0.29 a share from discontinued operations in 1995.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.13     loss	 $0.05</p>
<p> Net loss		  16,800     loss	   400</p>
<p> Revs		     166,500		  116,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,879		    7,191</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: FY96 includes loss of $15.2 million, or $1.93 a share from discontinued operations, compared to a $2.3 million, or $0.31 a share loss in 1995.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
